<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves slip below $3 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves slip below $3 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $2.999 billion as of July 17, down from $3.021 billion on July 9.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES    July 17   July 9   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)     2.999     3.021     3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	  3.671     2.622     2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector   6.671     5.643     5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
